• PassAuth now keeps a record of the items in each vault and warns you if your server hides a change, brings back a deleted item or shows an older copy.
• After a server restore, tap "Use the server's copy" once per vault to accept what the server has now.
• Items that can't be opened are listed and can be deleted.
• "Change server" now closes after it connects.
• Needs a server on version 0.12 or later.
